# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Must sit at the root of the build output, which is
# why it lives in public/ — Next copies public/ into out/ verbatim.
#
# The bare `/` has no page: every route lives under a locale segment, and a
# static export has no middleware. Without this rule the domain root 404s.
#
# Arabic is the default. `functions/index.js` runs BEFORE this and upgrades the
# decision to Accept-Language detection; this line is the fallback for when
# Functions are not deployed, so the root is never broken either way.
/    /ar/    302
